    "InternalName": "BOCCHI",
    "Punchline": "BOCCHI is here to smooth out your Occult Crescent experience.",
    "Description": "BOCCHI is here to smooth out your Occult Crescent experience.\n- No more of that pesky 'walking' or 'finding chests'. That's for losers.\n- A cute little Fate and CE panel that'll tell you what rewards it gives AND help you automatically path to it, wowee.\n- An extra illegal 'illegal mode' for those of you that would rather be touching grass or playing a game with worthwhile content.\n\nCommand prefix: bocchi (alias: och)\n  /bocchi → Opens the main window\n  /bocchi config → Opens config (aliases: cfg, c)\n  /bocchi config list → Lists config keys\n  /bocchi config get <key> → Prints a config value\n  /bocchi config set <key> <value> → Sets a config value\n  /bocchi buff → Start/stop a buff run\n  /bocchi tp [fate|ce|pot] → Teleport toward nearest matching activity\n  /bocchi illegal [on|off|toggle] → Control Illegal Mode (no arg opens the window)\n  /bocchi cmd flag-active-ce → Flag registering CE on the map\n  /bocchi cmd flag-active-fate → Flag a FATE on the map\n  /bocchi cmd flag-active-non-pot-fate → Flag a non-pot FATE\n  /bocchi reload-translations → Reload translation files (alias: rt)\n  /och … → Same as /bocchi (legacy alias; also /occultcrescenthelper)",
